I found two host API mismatches: the browser rejects close codes 1008 and 1009, and Java’s WebSocket client rejects 1009. The current test doubles accept those codes, so the green suites miss failures in the new overflow teardown paths. I’m documenting these as sign-off blockers, with the required fixes and verification.
